  "confirmed_causes_fixed": [
    "Importer discarded Forge blockstate transform when copying textures and parent/model, leaving identity GUI transforms for 3D machine geometry.",
    "Custom GUI translations used block units in Forge; modern display translation uses sixteenth-block units. Conversion now multiplies translation by 16 and preserves rotation composition and scale.",
    "Empty thaumometer inventory variant incorrectly shadowed its normal variant and scanner GUI transform.",
    "Metadata variant maps were missing or misspelled for turret, module, curio, amulet_vis, label and phial.",
    "Importer overwrote the block atlas and could remove animated strip/focus entries. It now merges sources.",
    "Blueprints used item models in place of world geometry. Separate world-model index preserves block/OBJ geometry and original facing rotations.",
    "Blueprint iron bars used isolated default state; the completed visible-cell view now supplies actual neighbor connections.",
    "Blueprint lava used an air-only view; it now receives the complete visible-cell view with correct section-relative vertex compensation.",
    "Static Golem Builder OBJ required its original TESR horizontal-center anchor rather than an ordinary block-corner anchor.",
    "Original OBJ MTL files contained Windows filesystem texture paths; NeoForge rejected the material resource locations. Import now preserves original material-name overrides as explicit #texture bindings and normalizes only valid fallback resource locations.",
    "One broken OBJ override invalidated the shared research_icon carrier, cascading to 137 custom-model-data selections; the initial 144 client audit errors were not 144 independent missing assets.",
    "Original pillar material fallback pointed at a Minecraft redstone texture instead of each model texture. Explicit #texture MTL binding restores all 12 world pillar texture variants.",
    "Importer forced flip_v=true for every OBJ. Forge 1.12 and NeoForge default false; only the original scanner explicitly requests true. Golem Builder sampled magenta unused texture islands despite resolving the correct sprite. Original per-model UV orientation is now retained without modifying PNG or OBJ bytes.",
    "Blueprint models used item/entity shaders that applied a second diffuse-light pass. BookBlocks now uses ModelBlockRenderer world tessellation and block/fluid RenderTypes, with full-bright blueprint context and GUI fog disabled only during that draw.",
    "World model orientation rotated geometry without changing BakedQuad.direction. The world wrapper now rotates positions, normals, cull query direction and shading face together, preserving block-center rotation and source quads.",
    "Legacy stone_arcane/stone_arcane_brick names resolve to the registered arcane_stone/arcane_brick states; unregistered ancient/eldritch stone use verified full-cube neighbor proxies rather than air."
  ],
